window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I'm in over my head, and Teale Delaney is the reason why. </p> <p>She's beautiful, sassy, and I can't stop thinking about her. </p> <p>If I let myself, I could fall in love. </p> <p>But I can’t. I won’t. </p> <p>It’s to protect her, not me. </p> <p>Someone out there wants vengeance. If I allow them to see my true feelings for Teale, they’ll stop at nothing to take her away. </p> <p>I’m lying to everyone around me to protect the only woman who can bring me to my knees. </p> <p>The Exposed Hearts Series are all standalone novels within an interconnected series. </p>"; 
